WEBVTT

00:00:29.854 --> 00:00:32.179
The next day, she was dead.

00:00:34.021 --> 00:00:37.179
Rebecca was 31 years old when she died.

00:00:37.657 --> 00:00:41.506
She had an eight-year struggle
with breast cancer.

00:00:41.530 --> 00:00:43.413
It came back three times.

00:00:43.879 --> 00:00:45.536
I failed her.

00:00:46.642 --> 00:00:49.042
The scientific community failed her.

00:00:49.579 --> 00:00:52.046
And the medical community failed her.

00:00:53.254 --> 00:00:55.054
And she's not the only one.

00:00:55.674 --> 00:00:57.569
Every five seconds,

00:00:57.593 --> 00:01:00.029
someone dies of cancer.